<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Drafts on Madhav Khosla</title><link>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/</link><description>Recent content in Drafts on Madhav Khosla</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>© Madhav Khosla</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 09 Nov 2023 02:01:58 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Torrent: 1. How a .torrent file works</title><link>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/torrent_file/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 Nov 2023 02:01:58 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/torrent_file/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/images/NQFCFTC.jpeg" alt="image"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="scope-of-this-blog"&gt;&#10; Scope of this blog&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#scope-of-this-blog"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;To be able to understand what a torrent file does. What does contents inside torrent file do.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="how-you-download-a-torrent"&gt;&#10; How you download a torrent.&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#how-you-download-a-torrent"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Say you were to download arch linux from the provided torrent file on the archlinux website. You would&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Download the file from the website&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;load the file onto a torrent client like deluge/transmission/uTorrent etc and it begins downloading.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="observing-a-torrent-file"&gt;&#10; Observing a torrent file&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#observing-a-torrent-file"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s disect the &lt;a href="https://archlinux.org/releng/releases/2023.11.01/torrent/"&gt;Arch Linux Iso&lt;/a&gt; and open the file.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The file looks alot gibberish but you can see some ascii charecters like d,i,i with numbers next to them and maybe some urls.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;this encoding of a file is called bencoding and it is a representation of a object similar to how yaml/json works.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;now that we know that it is bencoded, we should know how bencoding works.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="working-of-bencoding"&gt;&#10; Working of bencoding&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#working-of-bencoding"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="opening-torrent-file-in-a-bencoding-viewer-tool"&gt;&#10; Opening torrent file in a bencoding viewer tool&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#opening-torrent-file-in-a-bencoding-viewer-tool"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;this &lt;a href="https://chocobo1.github.io/bencode_online/"&gt;tool&lt;/a&gt; helps us open a bencoded file and let&amp;rsquo;s see it in JSON format.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s see the file in JSON which is more human readable format for an object.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;20&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;21&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;22&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;23&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;24&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;25&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;26&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-JSON" data-lang="JSON"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;comment&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Arch Linux 2023.11.01 &amp;lt;https://archlinux.org&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;created by&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;mktorrent 1.1&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;creation date&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1698821953&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;info&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;length&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;846540800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;archlinux-2023.11.01-x86_64.iso&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;piece length&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;524288&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;pieces&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;hex&amp;gt;27 51 12 5C 1A DB 1B......Ommited for ease.....&amp;lt;/hex&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;url-list&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://mirror.aarnet.edu.au/pub/archlinux/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://mirrors.rit.edu/archlinux/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://ftp.ek-cer.hu/pub/mirrors/ftp.archlinux.org/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://ftp.heanet.ie/mirrors/ftp.archlinux.org/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://mirror.puzzle.ch/archlinux/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://mirror.csclub.uwaterloo.ca/archlinux/iso/2023.11.01/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Omitted for ease&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Automating your Linux Development using Ansible and GNU Stow</title><link>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/ansible/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jun 2022 02:01:58 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/ansible/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="heading" id="automating-your-linux-development-using-ansible-and-gnu-stow"&gt;&#10; Automating your Linux Development using Ansible and GNU Stow&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#automating-your-linux-development-using-ansible-and-gnu-stow"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;</description></item><item><title>How to make a URL shortner</title><link>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/urlshortner/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jun 2022 02:01:58 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/urlshortner/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="heading" id="what-is-a-url-shortner-"&gt;&#10; What is a URL shortner ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#what-is-a-url-shortner-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is a service that takes in a larger URL and turns it into a smaller URL, for the sake of:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Convencice&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Tracking clicks&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Tracking where the URL was opened from.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;For Example:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Long URL: &lt;code&gt;https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/?ref_=nav_em_cs_bestsellers_0_1_1_2&lt;/code&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;Short URL: &lt;code&gt;http://MyWebSite.com/{key}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;We replaced the larger url with a unique key in out system from which we can identify our unique key.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="how-to-generate-a-key-"&gt;&#10; How to generate a key ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#how-to-generate-a-key-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;You need a way to transform your string to an other string, it could be either a set of random charecters or using a hashing algorithm.&#10;You use a hashing function to create a key that does not exist our system and is unique to a (long url) or (long url + user)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="what-is-hashing-and-a-hash-function-"&gt;&#10; What is hashing and a hash function ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#what-is-hashing-and-a-hash-function-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;hasing is the process of transforming a string to another key to a shorter representation, this is used in python to implement dictionaries which are also called &amp;ldquo;hash tables&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A hashing function is a function that transforms a larger string to a smaller one. A good hashing function is a function in which no two strings have the same hash.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Hashing function Example:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;6&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;key_str&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt; &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;key_str&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;abc&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;google.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ooabc&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;googgggle.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ooabc&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="collision-hash"&gt;&#10; Collision Hash&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#collision-hash"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s observe our hashing function.&#10;This hasing function is not the best function becasue two different URLs have exactly the same hash.&#10;The scenario when we have one same hash for two completely different inputs is called a hash collision.&#10;A good hasing algorithm has very less hash collisions.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="good-enough-hasing-algorithm"&gt;&#10; Good enough hasing algorithm&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#good-enough-hasing-algorithm"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;key_value_store&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;PREFIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;lmn&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;POST_FIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;abc&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;curr_hash&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;basic_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;curr_hash&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;key_value_store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;POST_FIX&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;PREFIX&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;curr_hash&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;basic_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;key_value_store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;curr_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;curr_hash&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;basic_hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;long_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;xyz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;google.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;goooogle.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;hash_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;gooooglee.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;key_value_store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# {&amp;#39;googxyz&amp;#39;: &amp;#39;google.com&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;goooxyz&amp;#39;: &amp;#39;goooo2gle.com&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;abcgxyz&amp;#39;: &amp;#39;goooo3glee.com&amp;#39;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="base-62-hashing"&gt;&#10; Base 62 Hashing&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#base-62-hashing"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="how-do-we-get-indexed-for-urls-"&gt;&#10; How do we get indexed for URLs ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#how-do-we-get-indexed-for-urls-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="how-to-store-shortened-urls-and-large-urls-"&gt;&#10; How to store shortened URLs and large URLs ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#how-to-store-shortened-urls-and-large-urls-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="how-to-redirect-urls-"&gt;&#10; How to redirect URLs ?&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#how-to-redirect-urls-"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="http-30x-codes"&gt;&#10; HTTP 30x Codes&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#http-30x-codes"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 class="heading" id="storing-clicks-and-information-about-it"&gt;&#10; Storing clicks and information about it.&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#storing-clicks-and-information-about-it"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;</description></item><item><title>Static and Dynamic Dispatch in Rust</title><link>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/dyn/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jun 2022 02:01:58 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://madhavkhoslaa.github.io/draft/dyn/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="heading" id="static-and-dynamic-dispatch-in-rust"&gt;&#10; Static and Dynamic Dispatch in Rust&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#static-and-dynamic-dispatch-in-rust"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading" id="summary-static-and-dynamic-dispatch-in-rust"&gt;&#10; summary: &amp;ldquo;Static and Dynamic Dispatch in Rust&amp;rdquo;&lt;span class="heading__anchor"&gt; &lt;a href="#summary-static-and-dynamic-dispatch-in-rust"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>